  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your connection to fire allows you to protect yourself from it, even as you rip away the protections of others. You have fire immunity equal to [[lookup 5+@level evaluate=true]]{5 plus your level}. Additionally, fire damage you deal ignores a target’s fire immunity.</p><p>At the start of a combat encounter, you [[/gain @hero.victories surge]]{gain a number of surges} equal to your Victories. Whenever you spend a surge to deal extra damage, you can make that damage fire damage.</p>",
